    {
      "at": "2026-08-24T20:45:00.456408Z",
      "owner_directive": "Plan: (1) commit the zarr store through the existing shared helper atomic_replace_dir instead of rmtree-then-rename, so the old store is renamed aside and rolled back on failure; (2) add retry-with-backoff to the two swap renames inside atomic_replace_dir, because a Windows probe shows a directory rename is denied by ANY open handle in its subtree; (3) apply the same helper to the SaveData zarr-store copy in the materialisation path, which also destroys the old output before writing the new one.",
      "reason": "plan"
    }
  ],
